  "intent": "把跨多个独立系统的长业务事务拆成一系列本地事务，用补偿动作处理失败。",
  "applicability": {
    "constraints": {
      "span": "across_independent_services",
      "isolation": "none_eventual_consistency",
      "compensation": "required_for_each_step",
      "coordinator": "orchestration_or_choreography"
    },
    "counterexamples": [
      "所有写操作在同一个数据库里——本地事务就能保证原子性，不需要 Saga",
      "业务允许\"部分成功且不需回滚\"（例如只是统计埋点）——补偿机制是过度设计"
    ],
    "alternatives": [
      "pattern.integration.transactional_outbox",
      "pattern.arch.unit_of_work"
    ]
  },
